  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, VRC does not offer a feature to manage permissions for friends. Unlike real life, VRC only distinguishes \"friends\" — but real life consists of both friends and acquaintances.\n\nNot every person I’m acquainted with is automatically a friend. Still, I’d like to stay in touch somehow — after all, we might become friends one day. Currently, VRC doesn't support this in any way.\n\nIt would be great if we could assign different permissions to the various favorite folders. For example, we could have a folder for acquaintances.\n\nUseful permissions could include:\n\n- Can see my location.\n\n- Can send me invites.\n\n- Can request invites to my instance.\n\n- Automatically accept invites to my instance.",
